---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import { href } from '../lib/paths';
---
<ol class="steps">
  <li class="step glass spot reveal" style="--i:0">
    <span class="step-num">1</span>
    <span class="icon-tile"><Icon name="usb" /></span>
    <h3>Flash a USB stick</h3>
    <p>Download the ISO and write it to a USB stick with balenaEtcher, Rufus or <code>dd</code>.</p>
  </li>
  <li class="step glass spot reveal" style="--i:1">
    <span class="step-num">2</span>
    <span class="icon-tile"><Icon name="monitor" /></span>
    <h3>Boot the PC from it</h3>
    <p>Start in UEFI mode with Secure Boot off. The screen shows an address, a QR code and a setup code.</p>
  </li>
  <li class="step glass spot reveal" style="--i:2">
    <span class="step-num">3</span>
    <span class="icon-tile"><Icon name="phone" /></span>
    <h3>Finish on your phone</h3>
    <p>Scan the code, pick a drive, set a password, and install. Then pair Moonlight at <code>vapor.local</code>.</p>
  </li>
</ol>
<p class="steps-more reveal"><a class="link-arrow" href={href('/install/')}>Read the full install guide<Icon name="arrow" /></a></p>

<style>
  .steps {
    list-style: none;
    display: grid; gap: 14px;
    counter-reset: step;
  }
  @media (min-width: 720px) { .steps { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 16px; } }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) { .steps { gap: 18px; } }
  .step { display: grid; gap: 14px; align-content: start; padding: 26px 24px 28px; }
  .step-num {
    position: absolute; right: 20px; top: 12px;
    font: 700 3.6rem/1 var(--display);
    letter-spacing: -.05em;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgb(120 190 255 / .5), rgb(120 190 255 / .04) 95%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text; color: transparent;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .step h3 { font-size: 1.2rem; }
  .step p { color: var(--text-2); }
  .steps-more { margin-top: 24px; }
</style>
